As a precondition to opening a covered account in the city, each applicant shall provide the city with the following personal identifying information of the customer:
(1) A valid government issued identification card containing a photograph of the customer;
(2) For customers who are not natural persons; a passport, a green card; or a photograph identification issued by the government of the personal permanent resident;
