a. Beer or malt beverage;
b. Wine;
c. Distilled spirits.
(2) Wholesale dealer licenses:
a. Beer or wine;
b. Beer and wine;
c. Distilled spirits;
d. Beer, wine, and distilled spirits.
(3) Retail consumption dealer:
a. Beer or wine;
b. Beer and wine;
c. Distilled spirits;
d. Beer, wine, and distilled spirts.
