d. Distillery with cocktail room and package sales license;
e. Growler shop license;
f. Alcoholic beverage caterer license;
g. Alcoholic beverage caterer event permit;
h. Art shop alcohol permit;
i. Beer and/or wine amenity permit;
j. Temporary on-premises consumption permit;
k. City special event alcohol permit;
l. Off-premises pouring permit;
m. Non-profit special event permit.
(Ord. No. 2020-09-01, § 1(Exh. A), 12-1-2020)
